#: cache.cpp:48
msgid "&Use Cache"
msgstr "Koristi &međumemoriju"

#: cache.cpp:52
msgid ""
"Click here if you want the web pages you view to be stored in your hard disk "
"for quicker access. Enabling this feature will make browsing faster since "
"the pages will only be downloaded as necessary.  This is specially true if "
"you have a slow connection to the internet"
msgstr ""
"Kliknite ovdje ako želite smještati web stranice koje gledate na disk. "
"Tako će pristup njima biti nešto brži jer će se skidati samo one koje "
"nemate na disku, što je vrlo zgodno ako imate sporiju vezu na internet "
"(modem?)."

#: cache.cpp:66 kcookiespolicies.cpp:108
msgid "Policy"
msgstr "Pravila"

#: cache.cpp:81
msgid "&Keep cache in sync"
msgstr "&Drži spremnik usklađen"

#: cache.cpp:83
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Select this if you want to verify whether the page cached in your hard disk "
"is still valid. If this is disabled, a cached copy of remote files will be "
"used whenever possible. You can still use the reload button to synchronize "
"the cache with the remote host."
msgstr ""
"Odaberite ovdje želite li provjeru kopije web stranice koja je snimljena na "
"vašem disku u predmemoriju. Ako se ovo onemogući, spremljena kopija će "
"biti korištena kada je god to moguće. Naravno, još uvijek vam ostaje "
"'Učitaj ponovo' gumb za usklađivanje kopije i stranice na mreži."

#: cache.cpp:100
msgid "Use cache if &possible"
msgstr "Koristi &predmemoriju ako je moguće"

#: cache.cpp:103
msgid "Enable this to always lookup the cache before connecting to the internet."
msgstr "Ovdje se bira pogled u predspremnik uvijek prije spajanja na mrežu."

#: cache.cpp:116
msgid "&Offline browsing mode"
msgstr "&Pretraživanje bez mrežne veze"

#: cache.cpp:118
#, fuzzy
msgid "Enable this to prevent HTTP requests by KDE applications by default."
msgstr "Odabiranjem onemogućavate httpd zahtjeve od strane KDE programa."

#: cache.cpp:135
msgid "Disk cache &size:"
msgstr "&Veličina predmemorije na disku"

#: cache.cpp:144
msgid ""
"This is the average size in KB that the cache will take on your hard disk. "
"Once in a while the oldest pages will be deleted from the cache to reduce it "
"to this size."
msgstr ""
"Ovo je prosječna veličina predmemorije na vašem disku u kB. Svako toliko "
"će stare stranice biti izbrisane kako nebi zauzimale previše mjesta."

#: cache.cpp:152
msgid "kB"
msgstr "kB"

#: cache.cpp:156
msgid "C&lear Cache"
msgstr "Obriši &međumemoriju"

#: cache.cpp:159
msgid ""
"Click this button to completely clear the HTTP cache. This can be sometimes "
"useful to check if a wrong copy of a website has been cached, or to quickly "
"free some disk space."
msgstr ""
"Kliknite ovaj gumb ako želite sasvim obrisati sadržaj HTTP predmemorije. "
"Ponekad je to korisno jer onda možete biti sigurni da gledate sadašnji "
"izgled stranice, a i oslobađate dio prosotra na disku."

#: cache.cpp:257
msgid ""
"This module lets you configure your cache settings. The cache is an internal "
"memory in Konqueror where recently read web pages are stored. If you want to "
"retrieve a web page again that you have recently read, it will not be "
"downloaded from the net, but rather retrieved from the cache which is a lot "
"faster."
msgstr ""
"Ovaj modul vam omogućava podešavanje predmemorije. Ta predmemorija je "
"spremnik samo za Konqueror, gdje on sprema nedavno posjećene stranice. Ako "
"želite ponovo gledati stranice koje ste nedavno posjetili, onda će se one "
"uzeti iz predmemorije (sa vašeg diska), umjesto sa mreže, što je "
"značajno brže."

#: kcookiesmain.cpp:29
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"This control module could not start the cookie server process.\n"
"It will not be possible to manage received cookies"
msgstr ""
"Ovaj modul nije mogao pokrenuti proces poslužitelja kolačića (cookie).\n"
"Primljene cookie neće biti moguće obrađivati."

#: kcookiesmain.cpp:39
msgid "&Policy"
msgstr "&Pravila"

#: kcookiesmain.cpp:45
msgid "&Management"
msgstr "&Vođenje"

#: kcookiesmain.cpp:82
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"<h1>Cookies</h1> Cookies contain information that Konqueror (or other KDE "
"applications using the HTTP protocol) stores on your computer, initiated by "
"a remote Internet server. This means that a web server can store information "
"about you and your browsing activities on your machine for later use. You "
"might consider this an invasion of privacy. "
"<p>"
" However, cookies are useful in certain situations. For example, they are "
"often used by Internet shops, so you can 'put things into a shopping "
"basket'. Some sites require you have a browser that supports cookies. "
"<p> Because most people want a compromise between privacy and the benefits "
"cookies offer, KDE offers you the ability to customize the way it handles "
"cookies. So you might want to set KDE's default policy to ask you whenever a "
"server wants to set a cookie, allowing you to decide. For your favorite "
"shopping web sites that you trust, you might want to set the policy to "
"accept, then you can access the web sites without being prompted everytime "
"KDE receives a cookie."
msgstr ""
"<h1>Kolačići</h1>"
" Kolačići sadrže određene podatke koje Konqueror (ili drugi KDE program "
"koji koristi httpd protokol) sprema na vaše računalo, po nalogu udaljenog "
"poslužitelja mrežnih stranica.To znači da mrežni poslužitelji mogu na "
"vaše računalo spremati podatke o vama i vašim aktivnostima, te ih kasnije "
"koristiti. Hoćete li ovo smatrati zadiranjem u vašu privatnost, morate "
"sami odlučiti. "
"<p> Ipak, ponekad su kolačići vrlo korisni, npr. prilikom kupovine, "
"spremate odabrane stvari u 'košaricu', koji u stvari čine kolačići. Neke "
"stranice zahtijevaju da imate uključene cookie-kolačiće. "
"<p>"
"Kako mnogi žele jedan kompromis između privatnosti i praktičnosti, KDE "
"vam nudi mogućnost da podesite rad sa kolačićima. Vi odlučite hoćete li "
"prihvatiti kolačiće sa posližitelja ili ne, te hoćete li primiti samo "
"jedan ili sve."

