#: kenvvarproxydlg.cpp:102
msgid ""
"Check this box to enable environment variable based proxy setup for HTTP "
"connections."
msgstr "Odaberite ovdje mogućnost "

#: kenvvarproxydlg.cpp:111
msgid ""
"<qt>Enter the name of the environment variable, eg. <tt>HTTP_PROXY</tt>, "
"used to store the address of the HTTP proxy server."
"<p>Alternatively, you can click on the <tt>\"Auto Detect\"</tt> button to "
"attempt automatic discovery of this variable.</qt>"
msgstr ""
"<qt>Unesite ime okolišne varijable, npr. <tt>HTTP_PROXY</tt>, koja "
"sadržava adresu http posrednika-poslužitelja."
"<p> Drugi način je da kliknete gumb <tt>'Automatsko nalaženje'</tt> i "
"pokušate automatsko pronalaženje vrijednosti varijable.</qt>"

#: kenvvarproxydlg.cpp:121 kmanualproxydlg.cpp:122
msgid "HTTP&S:"
msgstr "HTTP&S:"

#: kenvvarproxydlg.cpp:122
msgid ""
"Check this box to enable environment variable based proxy setup for secure "
"connections such as HTTPS."
msgstr ""
"Uvdje možete omogućiti podešavanje proxy-a za sigurne veze kao što  je "
"HTTPS protokol, na temelju okolišne varijable."

#: kenvvarproxydlg.cpp:130
msgid ""
"<qt>Enter the name of the environment variable, eg. <tt>HTTPS_PROXY</tt>, "
"used to store the address of the secure proxy server."
"<p>Alternatively, you can click on the <tt>\"Auto Detect\"</tt> button to "
"attempt an automatic discovery of this variable(s).</qt>"
msgstr ""
"<qt>Unesite ime okolišne varijable, npr. <tt>HTTPS_PROXY</tt>, koja "
"sadržava adresu sigurnog https posrednika-poslužitelja."
"<p> Drugi način je da kliknete gumb <tt>'Automatsko nalaženje'</tt> i "
"pokušate automatsko pronalaženje vrijednosti varijable/i.</qt>"

#: kenvvarproxydlg.cpp:142 kmanualproxydlg.cpp:152
